    {
      "author": "AshwinK1",
      "content": "Such a entertaining and women centric excellent come back movie for Samantha. Samantha playing key role is very nice to see. Gowthami and other casts are well placed in this movie. Samantha with her usual charming acting really rocked the screens with awestruck action sequences. After a long time Samantha really worked hard for such a power packed performance.\\\r\n\\\r\nThis movie is taken in a light-hearted and lot of fun elements added along with family sentiments made it very entertaining and interesting to watch.\\\r\n\\\r\nSamantha in the lead role, worked really hard to produce breath taking movie comeback. She has put lot of efforts for action sequence especially to get her physique toned up to suit this role worked out really well in the movie.\\\r\n\\\r\nOverall, a very good movie to sit back and enjoy this women centric master piece.",
